            d="M6 2V4M14 2V4M3 8H17M4 4H16C17.1046 4 18 4.89543 18 6V16C18 17.1046 17.1046 18 16 18H4C2.89543 18 2 17.1046 2 16V6C2 4.89543 2.89543 4 4 4Z"
